  <item>
    <title>vol.08_夏日运动大作战｜奥运加油×隔壁串台</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b3a6994b8eba7e7e4a819b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b3a6994b8eba7e7e4a819b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 Aug 2024 16:53:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期我们和非常喜爱的一档播客节目——隔壁电台共同录制的！</span></p><span></span><p><span>趁着奥运的机会，来和大家聊聊运动中那些有趣的小故事~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> 斯巴达勇士赛，当代年轻人的PYQ流量密码</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 干货！码住！比赛怎么报名？备赛训练计划怎么定？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1431">23:51</a> 全民运动时代，火出圈的运动赛事一波接一波</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a> 聊聊运动带给我们的那些影响（正面vs负面）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 小众运动大众化，蹭流乱象还是商业新抓手？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2284">38:04</a> 互联网健身：收藏了就是练了，智商税产品买了就是瘦了！（不接受任何反驳）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2737">45:37</a> 不流汗不用动，平地起腹肌，就问你心动不心动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3543">59:03</a> 你会在运动场景中去社交吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4021">1:07:01</a> 运动couple：不运动了还组CP吗？不组CP能当运动搭子吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4784">1:19:44</a> 差生文具多，别管练成啥样，装备必须狠狠氪金！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也有关于运动的难忘经历，欢迎在评论区和我们互动！最重要的是，别忘记点赞订阅加关注哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>隔壁电台小宇宙指路贴：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b0e973f0b53acaf2873ca4" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b0e973f0b53acaf2873ca4"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
