  <item>
    <title>vol.07_凉风遍广坐 悠悠夏日长｜清爽回归</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669d359c8fcadceb90e758d1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669d359c8fcadceb90e758d1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Jul 2024 16:21:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>随着入伏，天气也变得炎热了起来</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们就来聊聊炎炎夏日中那些好吃的好玩的~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a> 什么时间入伏？三伏天和节气有什么关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a> 三伏天里都吃些啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a> 吃瓜+“吃瓜”才是夏天的正确打开方式！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="559">09:19</a> 入伏莫贪凉，迈老师“铁胃”警告！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a> 哈啤酒吗？bro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">14:06</a> 夏日玩乐，电音节蹦野迪还是进山溯溪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1153">19:13</a> 嗡嗡嗡，蚊子大军还有0.5s到达战场！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1419">23:39</a> 在空调房间看部电影也不错</span></p><span></span><p><span>·萤火之森</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnrIcocTGIXkmDkRCQR9gfcCU62h.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>·小森林-夏秋篇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsGNn2jRbjDHJkOSjgHzpe-tWqhR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>·菊次郎的夏天</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhZv9fPYC678V8FglFVJMx03HWJh.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>如果你也有关于夏天的有趣故事，或是想要吐槽的，欢迎在评论区与我们互动~</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜欢我们节目的话，请多多推荐转发~最重要的是，别忘记订阅关注哦~</span></p>]]></description>
