    <guid isPermaLink="false">66535fbc4efbc0c3dc32afdb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 May 2024 16:13:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目，我们从水逆和地磁暴作为切入点</span></p><span></span><p><span>探讨了近年来年轻人对于"玄学"的拥抱态度和趋势</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 水逆和地磁暴都是个啥啊?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a> 要不是地磁暴，我还真不知道谁来帮我背锅了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="513">08:33</a> 渣我可以，挡我财路非分不可!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="661">11:01</a> 什么东方西方的，谁说我好我信谁！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">14:52</a> 思路打开!星座可不仅仅是算男女朋友的匹配程度!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a> 为什么当代年轻人开始拥抱玄学了?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1256">20:56</a> 资本入局玄学赛道，相关周边营销不断</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也有关于水逆、星座或者其他玄学概念的趣事，欢迎在评论区和我们互动~</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜欢我们节目的话，请多多推荐转发~最重要的是，别忘记订阅哦~</span></p>]]></description>
