  <item>
    <title>vol.05_谈恋爱治好了我的精神内耗！｜520特辑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664a3b7082b428eafda8292a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664a3b7082b428eafda8292a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 May 2024 17:48:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期520特别节目，我们从自身经历出发，</span></p><span></span><p><span>探讨了在爱与被爱的过程中，自我疗愈的过程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>与此同时，我们也回归到"爱"的本质，</span></p><span></span><p><span>对当代年轻人更新颖，更多样化的恋爱形式进行了讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望本期节目，可以给正在精神内耗的你一些治愈~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> 啥叫精神内耗啊?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> 为什么当代年轻人会精神内耗?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">06:06</a> 前"00后董秘"揭秘离职背后的故事！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="649">10:49</a> 他人即地狱!多关注自身，减少内耗!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1083">18:03</a> "纸性恋"也是恋！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> 原来我们早在嗑CP这词儿出现前就在磕了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 邪门CP拉郎配才更好磕！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1727">28:47</a> 现实CP的520赠言</span></p><span></span><p><span>【那些年我们嗑过的CP-不完全统计版】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoDn8ahxrH0flKCzxPkNQctTC3fS.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtgL1GE8PMY5g1JyybBQSoTVom0G.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>如果你也有战胜精神内耗的经历或者小tips欢迎在评论区和我们互动~</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜欢我们节目的话，请多多推荐转发~最重要的是，别忘记订阅哦~</span></p>]]></description>
