  <item>
    <title>vol.04_妈，我希望你不只是妈妈｜母亲节特辑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6640e59fb813c7172b9e7824</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6640e59fb813c7172b9e7824</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 May 2024 15:51:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期母亲节特别节目，我们邀请到了6位朋友，和我们分享了各自想对妈妈说的话</span></p><span></span><p><span>☛一念超人：知名自媒体博主(B站同名)</span></p><span></span><p><span>☛小韩同学：冉冉升起的艺术新星</span></p><span></span><p><span>☛二白：创一代新疆姑娘</span></p><span></span><p><span>☛S：沪上电商大佬</span></p><span></span><p><span>☛胖虎：游戏本地化幕后推(hei)手</span></p><span></span><p><span>☛Tony：本期年纪最小的嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 母亲节的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="272">04:32</a> 一念超人part</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">06:02</a> 小韩同学part</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">11:05</a> 和妈妈的看法不同时怎么解决分歧?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 二白part</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 如果不能陪在妈妈身边，如何拉进彼此距离？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> S的发言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1326">22:06</a> 胖虎part</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> 小嘉宾Tony部分</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也想通过我们的节目对妈妈表达你的爱，或是日常生活中有什么和妈妈相处的小tips，欢迎在评论区和我们互动！</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜欢我们节目的话，请多多推荐转发~最重要的是，别忘记订阅哦~</span></p>]]></description>
