  <item>
    <title>vol.03_今年五一，反向旅游上大分｜思路打开</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663fbed8b813c7172b751266</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663fbed8b813c7172b751266</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 May 2024 18:54:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目，我们讨论了最近大火的“反向旅游”概念</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>根据统计数据，我们能看到，今年五一小县城明显"跑赢”大城市，而且是越下沉越吃香</span></p><span></span><p><span>三四线城市旅游增速大于一二线城市，而县城又明显高于三四线城市</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>包邮区的高速服务区真的别太卷了叭！</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> "反向旅游"是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a> 反向旅游为什么受追捧，优点是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 今年五一县级旅游地热榜top10</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="446">07:26</a> 小众旅游地可能既不冷门，也不便利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="611">10:11</a> 足不出市，赛博旅游，服务区内卷，旅游的形式远比你想的要多！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a> come on！反向旅游怎么就消费降级了?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1027">17:07</a> "消费降级”这词儿谁发明的啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也有想分享的宝藏小众打卡地，请在评论区和我们互动！</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时，也请多多关注、订阅、转发~迈尔奈斯，你的数字铁瓷！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luk3G0BJhIWFUrNaKXj46wlBZIPs.m4a" length="14725132" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:20:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlTn2e3rX3zBFTRc4WUjAiWkvAIn.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.02_你是J人还是P人｜五一闲谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6637b9c84b7d3b5d3b3339a2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6637b9c84b7d3b5d3b3339a2</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目，我们想和大家聊聊MBTI中，J人/P 人的相关话题</span></p><span></span><p><span>其中，J（Judging）代表判断，P（Perceiving）代表感知</span></p><span></span><p><span>奈奈子（J人代表）和迈老师（千年P人）分别交换意见</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时，也欢迎大家留下自己的有趣观察，和我们互动！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【MBTI人格测试】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.16personalities.com/ch/%E4%BA%BA%E6%A0%BC%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95" data-url="https://www.16personalities.com/ch/%E4%BA%BA%E6%A0%BC%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95"><span>免费性格测试 | 16Personalities</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkMZrG6j-TJ5u8TwJji8xVwEEtdK.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> J人和P人分别代表什么?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 出门装备大不同！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">04:57</a> 尝试新品还是吃连锁？大胆拓新还是踏实跟导航？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> 单曲循环vs随机播放+随时切歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="728">12:08</a> 录音习惯不同，爆发矛盾！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> J 人也是有比较级的好嘛~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> P人&amp;J人磁场互换</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢我们的节目，希望可以多多转发、推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>迈尔奈斯，期待你的互动~</span></p>]]></description>
